Ethereum Classic is still here for a mix of ideology, miner economics, and a unique niche that no other major chain fully occupies.

It also has a positioning that is hard to replicate:

- Proof-of-work security
- Full EVM smart contracts
- A hard supply cap (~210.7 million ETC) with scheduled reward reductions

Bitcoin has PoW but no smart contracts. Ethereum has smart contracts but no PoW and no hard cap. ETC is the main chain that still has both the original design choices.